     - <h4>4A Converting MM to CM</h4>
     - <p>Convert the following mm measurements into centimetres by dividing the number by 10.</p>
     - <p>For example:</p>
     - <p>11mm =</p>
     - <p>11mm ÷ 10 = 1.1 cm</p>
     - <p>37mm =</p>
     - <p>37mm ÷ 10 = 3.7 cm</p>
